  "response": "## Finding: `crime_00070` — Duplicate Component Shape\n\nSame `<div className=\"mt-6 flex justify-end gap-4\">` footer (Cancel link + submit Button) in 4 invoice forms:\n\n| File | Lines |\n|---|---|\n| `dashboard/final-example/app/ui/invoices/create-form.tsx` | 142–150 |\n| `dashboard/final-example/app/ui/invoices/edit-form.tsx` | 152–160 |\n| `dashboard/starter-example/app/ui/invoices/create-form.tsx` | 101–109 |\n| `dashboard/starter-example/app/ui/invoices/edit-form.tsx` | 112–120 |\n\nOnly meaningful diff between copies: the submit button label (`Create Invoice` vs `Edit Invoice`). Cancel target, classes, layout, and Button are otherwise identical. (The sibling `aria-live` error block above also drifts — `mt-2` in create, `my-2` in edit — so worth folding in.)\n\n## Proposed shared component\n\n**Location:** `app/ui/invoices/form-actions.tsx` (per dashboard root; `final-example` and `starter-example` each get their own copy unless you also consolidate the two dashboards).\n\n**Public API:**\n\n```tsx\ntype InvoiceFormActionsProps = {\n  submitLabel: string;            // \"Create Invoice\" | \"Edit Invoice\"\n  cancelHref?: string;            // default \"/dashboard/invoices\"\n  pending?: boolean;              // disables submit while action runs\n};\n\nexport function InvoiceFormActions({\n  submitLabel,\n  cancelHref = '/dashboard/invoices',\n  pending,\n}: InvoiceFormActionsProps) { /* renders the mt-6 flex footer */ }\n```\n\n**Slots:** none needed — the shape is rigid (Cancel + one submit). If a future form grows a tertiary action, add a single `extra?: ReactNode` slot rendered before the submit button rather than turning this into a generic toolbar.\n\n**Call sites change to:**\n\n```tsx\n<InvoiceFormActions submitLabel=\"Create Invoice\" />\n<InvoiceFormActions submitLabel=\"Edit Invoice\" />\n```\n\n## Files that change\n\nEdits (replace lines 142–150 / 152–160 / 101–109 / 112–120 with the new component):\n- `dashboard/final-example/app/ui/invoices/create-form.tsx`\n- `dashboard/final-example/app/ui/invoices/edit-form.tsx`\n- `dashboard/starter-example/app/ui/invoices/create-form.tsx`\n- `dashboard/starter-example/app/ui/invoices/edit-form.tsx`\n\nNew:\n- `dashboard/final-example/app/ui/invoices/form-actions.tsx`\n- `dashboard/starter-example/app/ui/invoices/form-actions.tsx`\n\nScoped on purpose: `final-example` and `starter-example` are independent tutorial snapshots — collapsing them across that boundary is a bigger move than this finding asks for.",
